{
  "info": {
    "name": "Barrier — Risk Engine",
    "_postman_id": "b0a11e00-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
    "description": "API da Risk Engine (KYC/PLD-FT). Toda operação é autenticada por API key do tenant: `Authorization: Bearer brr_<keyId>_<secret>`. Em dev a chave é emitida no startup e sai no log da aplicação (procure por 'API key de DESENVOLVIMENTO'); copie para a variável `apiKey`.\n\nFluxos cobertos:\n- **Automático:** POST assessment → processamento assíncrono → GET reflete APROVADO/REPROVADO/EM_REVISAO.\n- **Revisão manual (EDD):** documento com apontamento (ex.: PEP) cai em EM_REVISAO → POST /decision aprova/reprova.\n- **CNPJ real:** bureau via BrasilAPI popula o CompanyProfile (abertura/CNAE/QSA) que alimenta as regras de risco de PJ.\n\nVariáveis: `baseUrl`, `clientId`, `assessmentId` (capturada automaticamente no POST), `document`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "apiKey", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "assessmentId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "document", "value": "11144477735", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["actuator", "health"] },
        "description": "Liveness/readiness da aplicação."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assessments",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Submit — CPF (fluxo automático → APROVADO)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('202 Accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('assessmentId', body.id);",
                  "pm.test('status EM_ANALISE', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('EM_ANALISE'));",
                  "console.log('assessmentId =', body.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"documentType\": \"CPF\",\n  \"document\": \"111.444.777-35\",\n  \"name\": \"Fulano de Tal\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "assessments"] },
            "description": "Submete uma avaliação (202). O processador conclui de forma assíncrona; use o GET para acompanhar."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit — CPF PEP (cai em EM_REVISAO)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('202 Accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('assessmentId', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "console.log('assessmentId (PEP) =', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"documentType\": \"CPF\",\n  \"document\": \"529.982.247-25\",\n  \"name\": \"Fulano Pep Exemplo\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "assessments"] },
            "description": "Documento com apontamento PEP (seed) → a regra de PEP força EDD → EM_REVISAO. Decida em `Decision — APPROVE/REJECT`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit — CNPJ (BrasilAPI → regras de PJ)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('202 Accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('assessmentId', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "console.log('assessmentId (CNPJ) =', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"documentType\": \"CNPJ\",\n  \"document\": \"18.236.120/0001-58\",\n  \"name\": \"Nubank\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "assessments"] },
            "description": "CNPJ real: o bureau (BrasilAPI) devolve situação cadastral + CompanyProfile (abertura/CNAE/QSA), que alimenta NewCompany/SensitiveCnae/CorporateStructure. Os `factors` no GET explicam a decisão."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get assessment",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "console.log('status =', b.status, '| risco =', b.riskLevel, '| factors =', JSON.stringify(b.factors));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments/{{assessmentId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "assessments", "{{assessmentId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Status/resultado da avaliação (escopo do tenant). Traz `factors` (explicabilidade) e a trilha de review quando houver."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Decision — APPROVE (EM_REVISAO → APROVADO)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('status APROVADO', () => pm.expect(b.status).to.eql('APROVADO'));",
                  "pm.test('trilha preenchida', () => pm.expect(b.reviewedBy).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"decision\": \"APPROVE\",\n  \"reviewedBy\": \"analista@empresa\",\n  \"reason\": \"EDD concluida, cliente conhecido\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/decision",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "assessments", "{{assessmentId}}", "decision"]
            },
            "description": "Decisão humana (EDD). Só vale a partir de EM_REVISAO — decidir fora disso responde 409. `reviewedBy` é obrigatório.\n\nObs.: evite acentos no `reason` ao testar via terminais que reescrevem o encoding; o corpo deve ser UTF-8 válido."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Decision — REJECT (EM_REVISAO → REPROVADO)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"decision\": \"REJECT\",\n  \"reviewedBy\": \"analista@empresa\",\n  \"reason\": \"risco acima do apetite\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/decision",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "assessments", "{{assessmentId}}", "decision"]
            },
            "description": "Reprova manualmente uma avaliação em revisão."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Subjects",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get subject por documento",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/subjects/{{document}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "subjects", "{{document}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna o subject (documento mascarado) só se o tenant tem vínculo; senão 404 (não vaza cliente de outro tenant)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update profile (cadastro CMN 4.753)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"birthDate\": \"1990-01-01\",\n  \"nationality\": \"Brasileira\",\n  \"occupation\": \"Engenheira\",\n  \"address\": {\n    \"street\": \"Rua A\",\n    \"number\": \"10\",\n    \"complement\": null,\n    \"district\": \"Centro\",\n    \"city\": \"São Paulo\",\n    \"state\": \"SP\",\n    \"zipCode\": \"01000-000\"\n  },\n  \"phone\": \"11912345678\",\n  \"email\": \"fulano@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/subjects/{{document}}/profile",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "subjects", "{{document}}", "profile"]
            },
            "description": "Cadastro progressivo (PUT parcial — campo omitido preserva o valor existente). Sem os campos mínimos do tipo de documento, a avaliação cai em EM_REVISAO mesmo com score baixo (RegistrationCompleteness)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Record history event (chargeback/PIX devolvido/fraude)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"eventType\": \"CHARGEBACK\",\n  \"detail\": \"Chargeback em compra de 2026-07-01\",\n  \"occurredAt\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/subjects/{{document}}/history",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "subjects", "{{document}}", "history"]
            },
            "description": "Endpoint interno/admin: registra um evento de histórico (CHARGEBACK/PIX_RETURNED/FRAUD_REPORT/ACCOUNT_CLOSED_FRAUD) que alimenta HistoryRiskRule nas próximas avaliações deste subject."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List history events",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/subjects/{{document}}/history",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "subjects", "{{document}}", "history"]
            },
            "description": "Lista os eventos de histórico interno já registrados para o subject."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tenant Risk Config",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upsert override de regra por tenant",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ruleCode\": \"NEW_COMPANY\",\n  \"paramKey\": \"months\",\n  \"paramValue\": \"12\",\n  \"updatedBy\": \"admin@barrier\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/{{clientId}}/risk-config",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "tenants", "{{clientId}}", "risk-config"]
            },
            "description": "Operação interna/admin — só regras de apetite de risco na allowlist (`NEW_COMPANY`, `SENSITIVE_CNAE`) aceitam override; regras regulatórias fixas (sanção/PEP/identidade/bandas) respondem 400."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get config efetiva do tenant",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/{{clientId}}/risk-config",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "tenants", "{{clientId}}", "risk-config"]
            },
            "description": "Merge default global + overrides do tenant, um item por (rule_code, param_key) configurável."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Rule Registry",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List regras (enabled/vigência/criticidade)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/risk-rules", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "risk-rules"] },
            "description": "Estado operacional de cada família de regra — kill switch global (todos os tenants), diferente do override por parceiro em Tenant Risk Config."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Desabilitar/reconfigurar uma regra",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"description\": \"CNAE sensível a PLD-FT\",\n  \"criticality\": \"ALERT\",\n  \"enabled\": false,\n  \"validFrom\": null,\n  \"validUntil\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/risk-rules/SENSITIVE_CNAE",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "risk-rules", "SENSITIVE_CNAE"]
            },
            "description": "Liga/desliga uma família de regra ou limita sua vigência, sem deploy — ajuste operacional de emergência."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
